#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:2
msgid "ssh-keygen"
msgstr "ssh-keygen"

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:4
msgid "ssh-keygen 用于生成、管理和转换认证密钥，包括 RSA 和 DSA 两种密钥。 密钥类型可以用 -t 选项指定。如果没有指定则默认生成用于SSH-2的RSA密钥。 ssh-keygen 还可以用来产生 Diffie-Hellman group exchange (DH-GEX) 中使用的素数模数。 参见模数和生成小节。 一般说来，如果用户希望使用RSA或DSA认证，那么至少应该运行一次这个程序， 在 ~/.ssh/identity, ~/.ssh/id_dsa 或 ~/.ssh/id_rsa 文件中创建认证所需的密钥。 另外，系统管理员还可以用它产生主机密钥。 通常，这个程序产生一个密钥对，并要求指定一个文件存放私钥，同时将公钥存放在附加了\".pub\"后缀的同名文件中。 程序同时要求输入一个密语字符串(passphrase)，空表示没有密语(主机密钥的密语必须为空)。 密语和口令(password)非常相似，但是密语可以是一句话，里面有单词、标点符号、数字、空格或任何你想要的字符。 好的密语要30个以上的字符，难以猜出，由大小写字母、数字、非字母混合组成。密语可以用 -p 选项修改。 丢失的密语不可恢复。如果丢失或忘记了密语，用户必须产生新的密钥，然后把相应的公钥分发到其他机器上去。 RSA1的密钥文件中有一个\"注释\"字段，可以方便用户标识这个密钥，指出密钥的用途或其他有用的信息。 创建密钥的时候，注释域初始化为\"user@host\"，以后可以用 -c 选项修改。"
msgstr "ssh-keygen is used to generate, manage, and convert authentication keys, including both RSA and DSA key types. The key type can be specified with the -t option; if not specified, an RSA key for SSH-2 is generated by default. ssh-keygen can also be used to generate the prime modulus used in Diffie-Hellman group exchange (DH-GEX) — see the moduli and generation section. Generally speaking, if a user wants to use RSA or DSA authentication, they should run this program at least once to create the necessary keys in ~/.ssh/identity, ~/.ssh/id_dsa, or ~/.ssh/id_rsa. In addition, system administrators can also use it to generate host keys. Typically, this program generates a key pair, asks you to specify a file to store the private key, and stores the public key in a file with the same name plus a \".pub\" suffix. The program also asks for a passphrase string — empty means no passphrase (a host key's passphrase must be empty). A passphrase is very similar to a password, but a passphrase can be a whole sentence, containing words, punctuation, digits, spaces, or any characters you like. A good passphrase is 30+ characters, hard to guess, and made up of a mix of upper/lowercase letters, digits, and non-alphabetic characters. The passphrase can be changed with the -p option. A lost passphrase cannot be recovered — if you lose or forget it, you must generate a new key and then distribute the corresponding public key to other machines. RSA1 key files have a \"comment\" field, which makes it easy for a user to identify the key, noting its purpose or other useful information. When a key is created, the comment field is initialized to \"user@host\", and can be changed later with the -c option."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:20
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:22
msgid "-a trials 在使用 -T 对 DH-GEX 候选素数进行安全筛选时需要执行的基本测试数量。"
msgstr "-a trials the number of primality tests to perform when using -T to screen candidate DH-GEX primes for safety."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:24
msgid "-B 显示指定的公钥/私钥文件的 bubblebabble 摘要。"
msgstr "-B shows the bubblebabble digest of the specified public/private key file."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:26
msgid "-b bits 指定密钥长度。对于RSA密钥，最小要求768位，默认是2048位。DSA密钥必须恰好是1024位(FIPS 186-2 标准的要求)。"
msgstr "-b bits specifies the key length. For RSA keys, the minimum is 768 bits, with 2048 as the default. DSA keys must be exactly 1024 bits (as required by the FIPS 186-2 standard)."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:28
msgid "-C comment 提供一个新注释"
msgstr "-C comment provides a new comment"

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:30
msgid "-c 要求修改私钥和公钥文件中的注释。本选项只支持 RSA1 密钥。 程序将提示输入私钥文件名、密语(如果存在)、新注释。"
msgstr "-c requests changing the comment in the private and public key files. This option only supports RSA1 keys. The program will prompt for the private key filename, the passphrase (if one exists), and the new comment."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:32
msgid "-D reader 下载存储在智能卡 reader 里的 RSA 公钥。"
msgstr "-D reader downloads the RSA public key stored on a smart card reader."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:34
msgid "-e 读取OpenSSH的私钥或公钥文件，并以 RFC 4716 SSH 公钥文件格式在 stdout 上显示出来。"
msgstr "-e reads an OpenSSH private or public key file and displays it on stdout in RFC 4716 SSH public key file format."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:35
msgid "该选项能够为多种商业版本的 SSH 输出密钥。"
msgstr "This option can export keys for several commercial versions of SSH."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:37
msgid "-F hostname 在 known_hosts 文件中搜索指定的 hostname ，并列出所有的匹配项。"
msgstr "-F hostname searches the known_hosts file for the given hostname and lists all matches."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:38
msgid "这个选项主要用于查找散列过的主机名/ip地址，还可以和 -H 选项联用打印找到的公钥的散列值。"
msgstr "This option is mainly used to find hashed hostnames/IP addresses, and can be combined with the -H option to print the hash of the found public key."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:40
msgid "-f filename 指定密钥文件名。"
msgstr "-f filename specifies the key filename."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:42
msgid "-G output_file 为 DH-GEX 产生候选素数。这些素数必须在使用之前使用 -T 选项进行安全筛选。"
msgstr "-G output_file generates candidate primes for DH-GEX. These primes must be screened for safety with the -T option before use."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:44
msgid "-g 在使用 -r 打印指纹资源记录的时候使用通用的 DNS 格式。"
msgstr "-g uses the generic DNS format when printing a fingerprint resource record with -r."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:46
msgid "-H 对 known_hosts 文件进行散列计算。这将把文件中的所有主机名/ip地址替换为相应的散列值。"
msgstr "-H hashes the known_hosts file. This replaces all hostnames/IP addresses in the file with their corresponding hash values."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:47
msgid "原来文件的内容将会添加一个\".old\"后缀后保存。这些散列值只能被 ssh 和 sshd 使用。 这个选项不会修改已经经过散列的主机名/ip地址，因此可以在部分公钥已经散列过的文件上安全使用。"
msgstr "The original file's contents are saved with a \".old\" suffix appended. These hash values can only be used by ssh and sshd. This option does not modify hostnames/IP addresses that are already hashed, so it can safely be used on a file where some public keys have already been hashed."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:50
msgid "-i 读取未加密的SSH-2兼容的私钥/公钥文件，然后在 stdout 显示OpenSSH兼容的私钥/公钥。 该选项主要用于从多种商业版本的SSH中导入密钥。"
msgstr "-i reads an unencrypted SSH-2-compatible private/public key file, then displays an OpenSSH-compatible private/public key on stdout. This option is mainly used to import keys from various commercial versions of SSH."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:52
msgid "-l 显示公钥文件的指纹数据。它也支持 RSA1 的私钥。"
msgstr "-l shows the fingerprint data of a public key file. It also supports RSA1 private keys."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:54
msgid "对于RSA和DSA密钥，将会寻找对应的公钥文件，然后显示其指纹数据。"
msgstr "For RSA and DSA keys, the corresponding public key file will be looked up, and then its fingerprint data displayed."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:56
msgid "-M memory 指定在生成 DH-GEXS 候选素数的时候最大内存用量(MB)。"
msgstr "-M memory specifies the maximum memory usage (in MB) when generating DH-GEXS candidate primes."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:58
msgid "-N new_passphrase 提供一个新的密语。"
msgstr "-N new_passphrase provides a new passphrase."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:60
msgid "-P passphrase 提供(旧)密语。"
msgstr "-P passphrase provides the (old) passphrase."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:62
msgid "-p 要求改变某私钥文件的密语而不重建私钥。程序将提示输入私钥文件名、原来的密语、以及两次输入新密语。"
msgstr "-p requests changing a private key file's passphrase without rebuilding the private key. The program will prompt for the private key filename, the original passphrase, and the new passphrase entered twice."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:64
msgid "-q 安静模式。用于在 /etc/rc 中创建新密钥的时候。"
msgstr "-q quiet mode. Used when creating a new key inside /etc/rc."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:66
msgid "-R hostname 从 known_hosts 文件中删除所有属于 hostname 的密钥。"
msgstr "-R hostname removes all keys belonging to hostname from the known_hosts file."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:67
msgid "这个选项主要用于删除经过散列的主机(参见 -H 选项)的密钥。"
msgstr "This option is mainly used to remove the keys of a hashed host (see the -H option)."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:69
msgid "-r hostname 打印名为 hostname 的公钥文件的 SSHFP 指纹资源记录。"
msgstr "-r hostname prints the SSHFP fingerprint resource record for the public key file named hostname."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:71
msgid "-S start 指定在生成 DH-GEX 候选模数时的起始点(16进制)。"
msgstr "-S start specifies the starting point (in hex) when generating DH-GEX candidate moduli."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:73
msgid "-T output_file 测试 Diffie-Hellman group exchange 候选素数(由 -G 选项生成)的安全性。"
msgstr "-T output_file tests the security of Diffie-Hellman group exchange candidate primes (generated by the -G option)."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:75
msgid "-t type 指定要创建的密钥类型。可以使用：\"rsa1\"(SSH-1) \"rsa\"(SSH-2) \"dsa\"(SSH-2)"
msgstr "-t type specifies the type of key to create. Available values: \"rsa1\" (SSH-1), \"rsa\" (SSH-2), \"dsa\" (SSH-2)"

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:77
msgid "-U reader 把现存的RSA私钥上传到智能卡 reader"
msgstr "-U reader uploads an existing RSA private key to a smart card reader"

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:79
msgid "-v 详细模式。ssh-keygen 将会输出处理过程的详细调试信息。常用于调试模数的产生过程。"
msgstr "-v verbose mode. ssh-keygen will output detailed debugging information about the process. Commonly used for debugging modulus generation."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:81
msgid "重复使用多个 -v 选项将会增加信息的详细程度(最大3次)。"
msgstr "Repeating the -v option multiple times increases the verbosity (up to 3 times)."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:83
msgid "-W generator 指定在为 DH-GEX 测试候选模数时想要使用的 generator"
msgstr "-W generator specifies the generator to use when testing candidate moduli for DH-GEX"

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:85
msgid "-y 读取OpenSSH专有格式的公钥文件，并将OpenSSH公钥显示在 stdout 上。"
msgstr "-y reads a public key file in OpenSSH's proprietary format, and displays the OpenSSH public key on stdout."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:88
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:117
msgid "``chmod 400 id_rsa.pub`` 赋予公钥400权限"
msgstr "``chmod 400 id_rsa.pub`` grants the public key 400 permissions"

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:119
msgid "id_rsa即私钥，备份至本地后将服务器上的删除。"
msgstr "id_rsa is the private key; back it up locally and then delete it from the server."

#: ../../linux/openssh/ssh-keygen.rst:121
msgid "``service sshd restart`` 重启ssh服务"
msgstr "``service sshd restart`` restarts the ssh service"

